---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ProjectCard from '../components/ProjectCard.astro';
---
<Base current="writing" title="Writing · Łukasz Wójcik" description="Notes, essays and the occasional long read: my personal blog and a Polish-language guide to Mastodon.">
  <h1>Writing</h1>
  <p class="tagline">Notes, essays and the occasional long read.</p>
  <div class="prose"><p>The blog is where I write at length. Shorter thoughts end up on <a class="inline-link" href="https://hachyderm.io/@lukem" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">Mastodon</a> and <a class="inline-link" href="https://bsky.app/profile/lukaszwojcik.eurosky.social" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">Bluesky</a>.</p></div>
  <div class="cards">
    <ProjectCard i={0} external href="https://blog.lukaszwojcik.net/" title="Personal Writing" text="The blog: everything I write, in one place." tags={['Blog']} />
    <ProjectCard i={1} external href="https://mastodon-poradnik.pl/" title="Guide to Mastodon" text="A Polish-language guide to Mastodon and the fediverse." tags={['Polish', 'Guide']} />
  </div>
  <h2 class="section-label">Books</h2>
  <p class="section-note">Between 2010 and 2015 I wrote two books and an ebook about WordPress. They were among the first on the subject by a Polish author.</p>
  <ol class="posts">
    <li class="post"><a href="https://helion.pl/ksiazki/wordpress-4-instalacja-i-zarzadzanie-lukasz-wojcik-magdalena-brod,wopr4i.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="--i:3"><time>2015</time><div><h3>WordPress 4. Instalacja i zarządzanie</h3><p>With Magdalena Bród. Helion, 224 pages. ISBN 978-83-246-9741-0.</p></div></a></li>
    <li class="post"><a href="https://helion.pl/ksiazki/wordpress-3-instalacja-i-zarzadzanie-lukasz-wojcik,worpre.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="--i:4"><time>2011</time><div><h3>WordPress 3. Instalacja i zarządzanie</h3><p>Written on my own. Helion, 200 pages. ISBN 978-83-246-2790-5.</p></div></a></li>
    <li class="post"><a href="https://lubimyczytac.pl/ksiazka/57888/wlasny-szablon-wordpress" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="--i:5"><time>2010</time><div><h3>Własny szablon WordPress</h3><p>An ebook, 49 pages. ISBN 978-83-61744-26-9.</p></div></a></li>
  </ol>
</Base>
